OL,3,GNEWSAWhy don't men talk about using
OL,4,Aweight-loss drugs?
OL,5,
OL,6,FI have always been a big lad. From
OL,7,Fbeing a child I was what you would call
OL,8,F"well nourished".
OL,10,FWhen I started edging towards showbiz
OL,11,Fin my twenties - getting into
OL,12,Fwrestling, acting and comedy - my size
OL,13,Fbecame part of my act. But, as I've got
OL,14,Folder, my weight has become anything
OL,15,Fbut a laughing matter.
OL,17,FAt 53, tipping the scales at more than
OL,18,F35st (222kg), I started having health
OL,19,Fcomplications. It became apparent my
OL,20,Ffamily were worried about me.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,447,440,260,160,0,100
