OL,3,GNEWSAWhy don't men talk about using
OL,4,Aweight-loss drugs?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, at my size, exercise was
OL,7,Fdifficult. I'd reached "circus
OL,8,Fattraction" level and had to make a
OL,9,Fchoice.
